Upstream --> Recipe : verified bytes; no target execution
Recipe --> Owned : all payload preserved except 3 metadata values
Dashboard --> Owned : normal file-key imports; local graph/build PASS
Owned --> CSS : exact declared dependency
CSS --> Merge : published replacement
CSS --> Aho : normal published dependency
Dashboard --> Query : existing override unchanged
Query --> Decoder : normal ^0.5.0 range
Dashboard ..> Vite : normal same-major dev dependency
Dashboard ..> Preview : synthetic ABI/wallet; no outbound provider
note bottom of Preview
  FVA/review/CI/release are separate gates.
  Zod and existing provider boundaries remain open.
end note
@enduml
